# Bot2 takes Whiplash Wordsmith with Act of Treason, then Shocks Bot1, the Wordsmith's owner: Bot1 is an opponent of its
# controller, so it has flying (CR 109.5, 611.3a); Act of Treason alone gives it only haste.
[Bot1 Deck]
Whiplash Wordsmith
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Swamp
Swamp x18
[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Act of Treason
Shock
Mountain x18
